<p>
  <b>{$summary}</b> - {$verdict}
</p>

<p>
  The sandbox cases as fetched pages: every case is a triple under
  <code>framework/_suites/</code> - the <code>.pad</code> its template, the <code>.txt</code>
  the outcome, an optional <code>.php</code> its variables - and each is rendered by one real
  request through <code>?framework/run</code>. A request per case is the isolation the
  sandbox rebuilds by hand, granted by construction; the price is nine hundred requests a
  run, which is why Test runs and a page load only reads.
</p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0">
  <tr><th>case</th><th>expected</th><th>status</th></tr>
  {tests}
    <tr>
      <td><a href="{$url}">{$name}</a></td>
      <td><code>{echo $want | ignore}</code></td>
      <td>{$status}{if $failed eq 1} - got <code>{echo $got | ignore}</code>{/if}</td>
    </tr>
  {/tests}
</table>
